@startuml
title Core Data Model
skinparam shadowing false

class Setting {
  +key: str <<PK>>
  +value: str
}

class Job {
  +id: str <<PK>>
  +url: str
  +title: str
  +status: str <<indexed>>
  +options_json: str
  +progress: float
  +speed: float?
  +eta: int?
  +total_items: int
  +completed_items: int
  +failed_items: int
  +current_item_title: str?
  +error: str?
  +download_dir: str?
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
  +started_at: datetime?
  +finished_at: datetime?
}

class JobItem {
  +id: str <<PK>>
  +job_id: str <<indexed>>
  +source_url: str
  +title: str
  +index: int
  +status: str <<indexed>>
  +progress: float
  +downloaded_bytes: int?
  +total_bytes: int?
  +speed: float?
  +eta: int?
  +output_path: str?
  +actual_width: int?
  +actual_height: int?
  +actual_format: str?
  +options_json: str?
  +requested_resolution: str?
  +fallback_resolution: str?
  +fallback_reason: str?
  +error: str?
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
  +started_at: datetime?
  +finished_at: datetime?
}

class JobEvent {
  +id: int <<PK>>
  +job_id: str <<indexed>>
  +item_id: str? <<indexed>>
  +event_type: str
  +payload_json: str
  +created_at: datetime
}

class JobRead {
  +items: list<JobItemRead>
  +actual_resolution: str?
  +actual_format: str?
  +resolution_fallback: ResolutionFallback?
  +elapsed_seconds: int
}

Job "1" --> "*" JobItem : contains
Job "1" --> "*" JobEvent : emits
JobItem "0..1" --> "*" JobEvent : item events
Job --> JobRead : projected by job_read_model
JobItem --> JobRead : projected by job_read_model
Setting ..> Job : download_dir / defaults\napplied on startup
@enduml
